[{"answer":"I've been meaning to ask you for some advice about restaurants.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I need to book somewhere to celebrate my sister's 30th birthday,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and I liked the sound of that place you went to for your mum's 50th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/3.mp3"},{"answer":"The Junction.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I'd definitely recommend that for a special occasion.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/5.mp3"},{"answer":"We had a great time there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Everyone really enjoyed it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Where is it again? I can't remember.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/8.mp3"},{"answer":"It's on Grayson Street, only about a 2-minute walk from the station.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh that's good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I prefer not to have to drive anywhere","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/11.mp3"},{"answer":"but I don't want to have to walk too far either.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, the location's perfect,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/13.mp3"},{"answer":"but that's not necessarily why I'd recommend it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/14.mp3"},{"answer":"The food's amazing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/15.mp3"},{"answer":"If you like fish, it's probably the best restaurant in town for that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/16.mp3"},{"answer":"It's always really fresh and there are lots of interesting dishes to choose from.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/17.mp3"},{"answer":"But all the food is good there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it really expensive?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/19.mp3"},{"answer":"It's certainly not cheap, but for a special occasion I think it's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/20.mp3"},{"answer":"It's got a great atmosphere","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/21.mp3"},{"answer":"and before dinner you can go up on the roof and have a drink.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/22.mp3"},{"answer":"It's really nice up there, but you need to book.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/23.mp3"},{"answer":"It's very popular as the views are spectacular.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/25.mp3"},{"answer":"So that's definitely a possibility then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there anywhere else you can think of?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... if you want somewhere a bit less formal, then you could try Paloma.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Where's that? I haven't heard of it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/29.mp3"},{"answer":"No, it's quite new.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/30.mp3"},{"answer":"It's only been open a few months, but it's got a great reputation already.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/31.mp3"},{"answer":"It's in a really beautiful old building on Bow Street.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I think I know where you mean.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Right beside the cinema.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I've only been there a couple of times, but I was really impressed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/36.mp3"},{"answer":"The chef used to work at Don Felipe's, apparently.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/37.mp3"},{"answer":"I was really sorry when that closed down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/38.mp3"},{"answer":"So is all the food they serve Spanish, then?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, you can get lots of small dishes to share,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/40.mp3"},{"answer":"which always works really well if you're in a group.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... worth thinking about.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, there's a lively atmosphere and the waiters are really friendly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/43.mp3"},{"answer":"The only thing is that you need to pay a £50 deposit to book a table.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/44.mp3"},{"answer":"A lot of restaurants are doing that these days.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I should have a look at the menu to check there is a good choice of vegetarian dishes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/46.mp3"},{"answer":"A couple of my friends have stopped eating meat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Not sure, I'd say the selection of those would be quite limited.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I've just thought of another idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you been to the Audley?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/50.mp3"},{"answer":"No, don't think I've heard of it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/51.mp3"},{"answer":"How's it spelt?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/52.mp3"},{"answer":"AUDLEY.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/53.mp3"},{"answer":"You must have heard of it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/54.mp3"},{"answer":"There's been a lot about it in the press.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't tend to pay much attention to that kind of thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/56.mp3"},{"answer":"So where is it exactly?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/57.mp3"},{"answer":"It's in that hotel near Baxter Bridge, on the top floor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, the views would be incredible from up there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I'd love to go.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/60.mp3"},{"answer":"I can't think of the chef's name, but she was a judge on that TV cookery show recently.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/61.mp3"},{"answer":"And she's written a couple of cookery books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, Angela Frayne.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/63.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, it's had excellent reviews from all the newspapers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/65.mp3"},{"answer":"That would be a memorable place for a celebration.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Definitely!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Obviously it's worth going there just for the view,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/68.mp3"},{"answer":"but the food is supposed to be really special.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/69.mp3"},{"answer":"She only likes cooking with local products, doesn't she?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. Everything at the restaurant has to be sourced within a short distance,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/71.mp3"},{"answer":"and absolutely nothing flown in from abroad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/72.mp3"},{"answer":"I imagine it's really expensive though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you could go for the set lunch.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/74.mp3"},{"answer":"That's quite reasonable for a top class restaurant, £30 a head.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/75.mp3"},{"answer":"In the evening, I think it would be more like £50.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/76.mp3"},{"answer":"At least that I should think,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/77.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'm sure everyone would enjoy it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/78.mp3"},{"answer":"It's not the kind of place you leave feeling hungry though, is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/79.mp3"},{"answer":"With tiny portions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/80.mp3"},{"answer":"No, the reviews I've read didn't mention that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/81.mp3"},{"answer":"I imagine they'd be average.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's all great...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-1-part-1-2025-07-21-19-05-23/83.mp3"}]
